# Ignore everything in staging EXCEPT:
#  - the .gitkeep that makes the dir exist
#  - selections.json files (the hand-edited/auditioned tagging output)
#  - candidates.json files (attribution for every staged file — losing
#    these means re-downloading everything to recover who took a photo)
#  - recordings.json (the audio pipeline's candidates.json: recordist,
#    licence and XC id for every staged recording)
#  - proposals.json (per-recording durations and confirmed clip
#    windows — birds:audio-upload cannot validate without them)
#  - the .gitignore itself
#
# Two depths, because flora stages at <code>/ and birds at birds/<code>/.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!*/
!*/*/
!*/selections.json
!*/candidates.json
!*/*/selections.json
!*/*/candidates.json
!*/*/recordings.json
!*/*/proposals.json
